<section class="section faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE PRESS RECORD</p><h2>A few good<br/><em>questions.</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Ask me something else ↗</a></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Can we direct the recording remotely?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. My studio supports SourceConnect, Cleanfeed, Zoom and SessionLink, so your team can join the session and give direction.</p></details><details><summary>What does your natural voice sound like?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>My natural accent is London Estuary: conversational, relatable and down to earth. I can move towards soft RP or a stronger London sound, and bring a range of accents to character work. <a href="/demos">Listen to the reels.</a></p></details><details><summary>Can you come to our studio?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>I have a base in London and a studio in Valencia, and can discuss recordings in the UK and Spain. <a href="/studio">Explore studio and in-person options.</a></p></details><details><summary>What should I send with an enquiry?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Your script or word count, the audience, the style you have in mind, your deadline, and where and how long the recording will be used. If you’d like a custom audition, include a short script extract.</p></details></div></section>
